  "content": {
    "title": "Taylor Frankie Paul's 3 Kids: All About “The” “Secret Lives of Mormon Wives” Star's Daughter Indy and Sons Ocean and Ever",
    "text": "NEED TO KNOWTaylor Frankie Paul has three children: Indy, Ocean and EverThe Secret Lives of Mormon Wives star welcomed her older two children with her ex-husband, Tate Paul, and her youngest child with her ex-boyfriend, Dakota MortensenAfter a tumultuous few years in her personal life, Taylor has said she's focusing on being \"better\" for her kids and prioritizing their happinessTaylor Frankie Paul may be at the center of the #MomTok sex scandal, but her top priority is her daughter, Indy, and sons, Ocean and Ever.The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives star welcomed two children with her ex-husband, Tate Paul. The pair got married in November 2016 and, less than a year later, they welcomed their daughter, Indy. In 2020, they expanded their family once again with the birth of their son, Ocean.Prior to filming, Taylor began dating her ex-boyfriend, Dakota Mortensen. Their relationship was captured on the show, which explored their ups and downs along with the birth of their first child together. The couple welcomed a baby boy, Ever, in March 2024 before ultimately splitting around September.In February 2023, Taylor was arrested on misdemeanor charges of assault, criminal mischief and commission of domestic violence in the presence of a child. She pleaded guilty in August 2023 to aggravated assault and the other charges were dismissed, per the New York Post.“I want to [be better] for my kids and I feel like right now, that’s my top priority,” she said on Nick Viall’s podcast, The Viall Files, that same month. “All I want is them to be happy.”Here’s everything to know about Taylor Frankie Paul’s three children: Indy, Ocean and Ever.Indy May Paul, 8Taylor Frankie Paul and her daughter Indy on her 6th birthday in August 2023Credit: Taylor Frankie Paul/InstagramTaylor and her ex-husband, Tate, welcomed their first child together, daughter Indy May, on Aug. 31, 2017, nine months after they tied the knot.The following day, she announced her birth with an Instagram post.“Indy May Paul officially arrived Aug 31st weighing 6lbs 9oz. She is perfection and we are so obsessed with our baby girl. 💗 we are so blessed,” she wrote alongside a photo of her and Tate with their newborn daughter in the hospital.Taylor Frankie Paul's daughter Indy on her first day of kindergarten in August 2022Credit: Taylor Frankie Paul/InstagramFollowing her birth, Taylor continued sharing photos of Indy, including various milestones, holidays and sweet images of her and Indy wearing matching outfits, such as twinning Easter dresses or Christmas pajamas.She also described Indy as being both “sweet” and “sassy” in an Instagram post for her 4th birthday.“Indy is extremely smart and is the cutest big sis to Ocean,” she wrote alongside several photos of the two. “She loves make up, nails, dresses, anything girly. Starts school here soon and excited to see her next phase of life. I love my babies more words can say💛.”Ocean Paul, 5Taylor Frankie Paul's son Ocean in August 2024Credit: Taylor Frankie Paul/InstagramTaylor and Tate welcomed their second child, son Ocean, on June 18, 2020.In December 2019, the influencer announced that she was expecting on Instagram. “Walking into second trimester✨(my fav trimester) baby Paul will be here June 2020! Also Thank you everyone for the kind words and support yesterday🙏🏼,” she wrote alongside mirror photos of her cradling her growing bump.Following the announcement, Taylor began documenting her pregnancy on TikTok, and in June, she shared a video, introducing her newborn son to the world. “Ocean Paul arrived 4 days ago. 6 lbs 15 oz with lots of hair and a sweet soul,” she wrote in the caption.Two years later, in June 2022, Taylor revealed that she and Tate were getting a divorce following an “emotional affair” she had when they were engaged in “soft swinging” with other couples in their friend group.Taylor Frankie Paul's son Ocean in April 2024Credit: Taylor Frankie Paul/InstagramDuring an appearance on The Viall Files podcast in September 2024, Taylor revealed that although Tate considered joining the cast of The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives, he and his girlfriend ultimately decided not to participate. Their children are also kept off the show for their privacy.Despite their messy split, the pair are on good terms now.“We're great. We go to soccer games every week together and we talk daily,” she said. “I mean you kind of have to do co-parenting. You don’t have to be friends, but we are.”Ever True Mortensen, 2Taylor Frankie Paul and son Ever on his 1st birthday in March 2025Credit: Taylor Frankie Paul/InstagramShortly after her divorce, Taylor began dating Dakota and the couple welcomed their first baby together, son Ever True, on March 19, 2024.In September 2023, Taylor announced that she was pregnant, almost a year after experiencing an ectopic pregnancy. “One year later we've been blessed with our rainbow baby,” she wrote in a now-deleted Instagram post. “It's been a very emotional journey from last year till now and I can honestly say I'm so excited for this new chapter of life with Dakota, my children and this baby.”She went on to note that although she was feeling both excitement and anxiety, her pregnancy was \"healthy and on track.\"In April 2024, Taylor shared that her son was born a month earlier. “Ever True was born March 19th, 6lbs 15oz a week early and we’ve had the best two weeks with him. We all love you so much, thank you for blending our family 🤍,” she wrote on Instagram.Taylor Frankie Paul and ex-boyfriend Dakota Mortensen with son Ever on his 1st birthday in March 2025Credit: Taylor Frankie Paul/InstagramA few weeks later, she explained why they chose his moniker, writing on Instagram, “The name Ever meaning: always, eternity, and strong as a boar.”While Taylor and Dakota were focused on raising their son together, they ultimately broke up months after Ever was born, with Taylor confirming the split in January 2025. As of now, the two remain focused on co-parenting amicably.In March, they reunited to celebrate their son’s first birthday. Taylor shared an Instagram reel from his party, where Dakota was present along with other friends and family. She also shared another Instagram post with a heartfelt birthday tribute for her youngest child.“I don’t know how I got so lucky to be your mommy,” she wrote alongside a series of photos. “He is the sweetest soul and loves love. Needy like his daddy and stubborn like his mommy. Just as hyper as his sister and brother. Couldn’t be more loved by his village he has beside him.”She continued, “This one is emotional because it’s been such a transition phase this last year, and I just want us all to find peace in whatever direction it goes. I love you my baby boy.”Read the original article on People",
